      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The Linux SPI subsystem was written by David Brownell and merged in Linux 2.6.16 [(commit 8ae12a0d)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/8ae12a0d85987dc138f8c944cb78a92bf466cea0):",
      "source_hash": 6824919508759360397,
      "context_hash": 14005382884618921415,
      "translation": "리눅스 SPI 서브시스템은 David Brownell이 작성했으며 Linux 2.6.16에 병합되었습니다 [(commit 8ae12a0d)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/8ae12a0d85987dc138f8c944cb78a92bf466cea0):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "David": "David",
        "Linux": "Linux",
